from pathlib import Path
import json,collections
P=Path(__file__).parent
def write(n,x):(P/n).write_text(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2,sort_keys=True)+'\n')
reviews={}
for l in (P/'reviews.tsv').read_text().splitlines():
 i,c,q,d=l.split('\t');reviews[int(i)]=(c,q,d)
rs=json.loads((P/'literal-records.json').read_text());assert len(reviews)==len(rs)==50
ds=[]
for x in rs:
 r=x['record'];i=r['mathdb_id'];c,q,d=reviews[i]
 e={k:v for k,v in x.items() if k!='record'}
 e.update(exact_utf8_statement=r['statement'],source_url=r['source_url'],source_version='mirror literal bound to r301; selected versioned primary PDFs separately recorded',technical_statement_class=c,complete_self_contained_statement=c=='complete',complete_mathematical_statement_review=c=='complete',quantifiers_and_scope=q,individual_disposition=d,evidence_level='literal record technical screening',accepted_credit=0,current_registry_cleared=False,novelty_status='HOLD',source_body_coverage='none')
 if i in [378051,381789,379940]:
  e.update(source_body_coverage='selected primary passages; see primary-notes.md',evidence_level='literal and selected primary-body screening')
 if i in [378051,381789]:e['novelty_status']='EXCLUDE_EXISTING_PRIMARY_RESOLUTION'
 if i==384464:e['novelty_status']='EXCLUDE_WORDING_ONLY'
 ds.append(e)
write('dispositions.json',ds);write('proposals.json',[])
counts=dict(collections.Counter(d['technical_statement_class'] for d in ds))
write('source-coverage.json',{'literal_records':50,'classes':counts,'primary_selected_records':[378051,379940,381789],'whole_papers_read':0,'full_dependency_audits':0,'current_registry':'unavailable HOLD; no absence inference','primary_bodies':{'independent':'introduction only','interpolation':'definitions, Theorems 1/3 and selected proofs; primary-notes.md exact extracted lines','kings':'definitions/Conjecture1/Theorem1 beginning proof/Theorem4 statement; not whole body','rainbow':'Conjecture1.2/Theorem1.3/Lemma3.8 proof/Theorem3.9; not full dependency chain'},'outbound_requests':4,'mathdb_requests':0,'successor_search_limits':'selected known interpolation successor; no general literature clearance','new_credit':0})
(P/'SUMMARY.md').write_text('# r620 independent breadth handback\n\nExactly 50 assigned literal records technically screened, with individual scope/dispositions and exact UTF-8/canonical hashes. No replacement of incomplete records. Classes: '+str(counts)+'.\n\nZero proposals and zero credit. Three rows received selected primary-body screening (378051, 379940, 381789); zero whole-paper or full-dependency audits. 378051 has an existing limit theorem; 381789 is already refuted in its source, whose r=3 exception the mirror prose obscures. Kings 379940 remains HOLD; exhaustive n<=4 maxima 1,2,6,9 are finite evidence only. Scalar 384464 only exposes wording, no credit.\n\nIntegrity: r619 baseline 6,433 reported literal reviews, two breadth reservations (r616 and r620), focused 338366 untouched, 338408 parked. All 20 original r301 chunks and eight frozen inputs checked in place, direct intake original/copy pairs checked, no upstream verifier executed. 8,000 routing rows confer no review credit. No shared files, corpus copies, children, git, Lean or manuscripts changed. Counts remain 9 additional /39 total /next40.\n\nAccess: four successful generic-header versioned arXiv PDF fetches. Zero MathDB requests. All restricted/parked routes, including OEIS A274199, remain untouched. Current registry unavailable: HOLD. Source coverage and primary-notes distinguish statements, selected proof passages, and unread dependencies.\n\nRun ./verify.sh for independent read-only payload/original verification. Final receipt records manifest SHA256/size and bounded hash/size/extra-file rejection tests. Integrity PASS is neither mathematics nor novelty PASS.\n')
(P/'failures.md').write_text('# Failures, stopped routes and limits\n\n- First bind.py run stopped before content reads: source catalogue path used frontier/sources instead of repository sources. FileNotFoundError, guard exit1, no binding receipt created. Corrected parent index and reran under unchanged guard; PASS. No mismatch suppressed.\n- No HTTP errors in this lane; four PDF fetches returned200. No forbidden retry or alternate route. MathDB429 HOLD, AIM/Kourovka/EGRES/AIProofWatch parked; DMGT TLS, ProjectEuclid challenge, ResearchGate403 and OEIS A274199403 remain parked. No Google/GitHub/ScienceDirect/browser routes used.\n- No cached matching primary files identified in bounded filename inventory for the selected arXiv IDs; no historical tree copied.\n- Kings route stopped after source comparison and n<=4 enumeration: no exact 0.6 upper-bound mechanism and no constant-deficit boundary construction. No full-scope candidate proof or disproof.\n- Many rows are definition-dependent or incomplete despite mirror full labels. No label used as technical evidence. 383259/383716 contain no theorem; not silently replaced.\n- Current registry unavailable. No live registry absence, global novelty clearance, complete proof-body or formal pass claimed.\n- No promising unexcluded route justified successor fishing for the remaining rows; primary/successor bodies there remain unread and HOLD.\n')
print(counts)
